---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" description="Sijo Sam's resume — Technical Lead & Software Engineer">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 sm:mb-24 px-2">

        <header class="mb-8 pt-6">

            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-4">
                <div>
                    <h1 class="font-display font-extrabold text-3xl text-ink">Sijo Sam</h1>
                    <p class="text-lg text-fontPrimary/80 mt-0.5">
                        Technical Lead &amp; Full-Stack Engineer
                    </p>

                    <div class="mt-3 space-y-0.5 text-sm text-fontPrimary/80">
                        <p>Kerala, India</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-sm">
                        <a
                            href="mailto:sijo@sijosam.com"
                            class="text-fontPrimary/80 hover:text-fontPrimary underline decoration-solid"
                        >
                            sijo@sijosam.com
                        </a>

                        <a
                            href="https://www.sijosam.com/"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noopener noreferrer"
                            class="text-fontPrimary/80 hover:text-fontPrimary underline decoration-solid"
                        >
                            sijosam.com
                        </a>

                        <a
                            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sijo-sam/"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noopener noreferrer"
                            class="text-fontPrimary/80 hover:text-fontPrimary underline decoration-solid"
                        >
                            LinkedIn
                        </a>

                        <a
                            href="https://github.com/mrSamDev"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noopener noreferrer"
                            class="text-fontPrimary/80 hover:text-fontPrimary underline decoration-solid"
                        >
                            GitHub
                        </a>

                        <a
                            href="https://www.npmjs.com/~mrsamdev"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noopener noreferrer"
                            class="text-fontPrimary/80 hover:text-fontPrimary underline decoration-solid"
                        >
                            npm
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <section class="mb-9">
            <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-fontPrimary/70 border-b border-fontPrimary/35 pb-2 mb-4">
                Professional Summary
            </h2>

            <p class="text-base text-fontPrimary/85 leading-relaxed">
                Technical Lead and Full-Stack Engineer with 8+ years building and
                modernising enterprise web platforms using Node.js, React, React
                Native, TypeScript, GraphQL, and cloud infrastructure. I've
                re-architected large legacy codebases, shipped performance
                improvements of 30%+ across production systems, and owned complex
                API and backend integrations end to end. I also lead teams when
                the work calls for it, but the code is where I live.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-9">
            <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-fontPrimary/70 border-b border-fontPrimary/35 pb-2 mb-4">
                Technologies &amp; Skills
            </h2>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm">
                <span class="font-semibold text-fontPrimary whitespace-nowrap">Languages</span>
                <span class="text-fontPrimary/90">TypeScript, JavaScript, Go, Python, Lua, GraphQL</span>

                <span class="font-semibold text-fontPrimary whitespace-nowrap">Frontend</span>
                <span class="text-fontPrimary/90">React 19, React Native, Next.js, Remix, Svelte, SolidJS, Tailwind CSS, Redux Toolkit, RTK Query, Vite, Webpack</span>

                <span class="font-semibold text-fontPrimary whitespace-nowrap">Backend</span>
                <span class="text-fontPrimary/90">Node.js, REST APIs, GraphQL, FastAPI, event-driven architecture, message queues, payment integrations</span>

                <span class="font-semibold text-fontPrimary whitespace-nowrap">Data / Infra</span>
                <span class="text-fontPrimary/90">PostgreSQL, MongoDB, AWS (EC2, CloudFront, ALB, ACM), GCP, Docker, Kubernetes, Terraform, Nginx</span>

                <span class="font-semibold text-fontPrimary whitespace-nowrap">Observability</span>
                <span class="text-fontPrimary/90">Grafana, Ollama, structured logging, production monitoring</span>

                <span class="font-semibold text-fontPrimary whitespace-nowrap">Testing</span>
                <span class="text-fontPrimary/90">Jest, Vitest, Cypress, React Testing Library, Storybook</span>

                <span class="font-semibold text-fontPrimary whitespace-nowrap">Practices</span>
                <span class="text-fontPrimary/90">System design, CSR/SSR/ISR, microservices, CI/CD, TDD, SOLID, Agile (CSM)</span>

                <span class="font-semibold text-fontPrimary whitespace-nowrap">Performance</span>
                <span class="text-fontPrimary/90">LCP, INP, FCP, Core Web Vitals, Lighthouse, technical SEO</span>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-9">
            <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-fontPrimary/70 border-b border-fontPrimary/35 pb-2 mb-5">
                Work Experience
            </h2>

            <div class="space-y-8">

                <article class="pl-4 border-l-2 border-fontPrimary/30">
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-0.5 mb-1">
                        <div>
                            <span class="font-semibold text-fontPrimary">Technical Lead</span>
                            <span class="text-fontPrimary/70 mx-1.5">·</span>
                            <span class="font-medium text-fontPrimary/80">Gadgeon</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-xs text-fontPrimary/70 shrink-0">May 2025 – Present</span>
                    </div>

                    <p class="text-xs text-fontPrimary/70 mb-3">SaaS Products · Kochi, Kerala</p>

                    <ul class="list-disc ml-4 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-fontPrimary/85 leading-relaxed">
                        <li>
                            Led migration of a 100k+ line Angular 13 codebase to React 19,
                            covering architecture decisions, component decomposition, and
                            state management patterns using Zustand
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Drove HLD and LLD for new platform capabilities across the SaaS
                            enterprise product, covering API integrations, deployment
                            workflows, and shared frontend infrastructure
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Built a reusable analytics and reporting dashboard component
                            library adopted across multiple product verticals, reducing
                            per-feature UI build time significantly
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Introduced and standardised AI-assisted development using Claude
                            Code and Windsurf — ran hands-on workshops, set usage
                            guidelines, and improved delivery throughput by 10%
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Conducted structured code reviews and knowledge-sharing
                            sessions; directly mentored three developers into independent
                            ownership of complex feature areas
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Leading a team migrating features from an acquired platform
                            (Pimcore, PHP, Vue) into the core product, working across a
                            mixed stack including Blazor and .NET to integrate and
                            re-platform existing functionality
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-fontPrimary/80">
                        Stack: React 19, Node.js, Python, Zustand, MUI, Docker, GCP, AWS, Terraform, Pimcore, PHP, Vue, Blazor, .NET, Spring Boot
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="pl-4 border-l-2 border-fontPrimary/30">
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-0.5 mb-1">
                        <div>
                            <span class="font-semibold text-fontPrimary">Technical Lead</span>
                            <span class="text-fontPrimary/70 mx-1.5">·</span>
                            <span class="font-medium text-fontPrimary/80">Diagnal Technologies</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-xs text-fontPrimary/70 shrink-0">2022 – 2025</span>
                    </div>

                    <p class="text-xs text-fontPrimary/70 mb-3">Digital Media &amp; Streaming · London, UK (remote)</p>

                    <ul class="list-disc ml-4 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-fontPrimary/85 leading-relaxed">
                        <li>
                            Modernised frontend architecture across large-scale video
                            streaming platforms, migrating legacy React patterns to
                            functional components and redesigning rendering pipelines that
                            cut load times by 30% and reduced LCP significantly
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Owned technical SEO end to end: migrated to an SSR rendering
                            platform, restructured meta and content layers, and grew
                            organic search rankings by 50%
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Designed and led API integration work connecting streaming clients to backend content delivery and licensing services via GraphQL and REST
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Fast-tracked to Technical Lead after 18 months; led distributed
                            international teams across time zones, ran structured 1:1s, and
                            reduced code error rates by 35%
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Shipped across web, mobile, and connected TV surfaces using
                            React, React Native, Next.js, GraphQL, Redux Toolkit, and Astro
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-fontPrimary/80">
                        Stack: React, React Native, Next.js, GraphQL, Node.js, Tailwind, Redux Toolkit, AWS, Netlify, Astro
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="pl-4 border-l-2 border-fontPrimary/30">
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-0.5 mb-1">
                        <div>
                            <span class="font-semibold text-fontPrimary">Software Developer</span>
                            <span class="text-fontPrimary/70 mx-1.5">·</span>
                            <span class="font-medium text-fontPrimary/80">HyperBlox</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-xs text-fontPrimary/70 shrink-0">2020 – 2022</span>
                    </div>

                    <p class="text-xs text-fontPrimary/70 mb-3">IDE Products · Bangalore, India</p>

                    <ul class="list-disc ml-4 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-fontPrimary/85 leading-relaxed">
                        <li>
                            Architected the browser-based IDE for HyperBlox's IoT and 5G
                            platform, including compiler workflow integration, Lua runtime
                            bridging, and distributed execution support, cutting
                            application development time by 30%
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Collaborated directly with the CTO on compiler design and
                            runtime integration for enterprise-scale deployments; built the
                            abstractions that let product teams ship features without
                            touching low-level platform code
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Designed reusable frontend and backend abstractions that
                            reduced duplicated engineering effort; served as Scrum Master
                            and Project Owner for core platform delivery
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-fontPrimary/80">
                        Stack: React, Node.js, MUI, Redux, Docker, Lua, ShellScript, Kubernetes, MongoDB
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="pl-4 border-l-2 border-fontPrimary/30">
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-0.5 mb-1">
                        <div>
                            <span class="font-semibold text-fontPrimary">Software Developer</span>
                            <span class="text-fontPrimary/70 mx-1.5">·</span>
                            <span class="font-medium text-fontPrimary/80">7th Pillar Ventures</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-xs text-fontPrimary/70 shrink-0">2018 – 2020</span>
                    </div>

                    <p class="text-xs text-fontPrimary/70 mb-3">SaaS Products · Kochi, India</p>

                    <ul class="list-disc ml-4 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-fontPrimary/85 leading-relaxed">
                        <li>
                            Built full-stack SaaS products across healthcare, retail, and
                            travel, owning both frontend and backend delivery for
                            business-critical features that improved client operational
                            efficiency by 20%
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Accelerated product delivery for multiple startup clients,
                            covering web and mobile with React, React Native, Node.js, and
                            Next.js
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-fontPrimary/80">
                        Stack: React, React Native, Node.js, Next.js, MUI, SCSS, Redux, AWS, GCP, Firebase, MongoDB
                    </p>
                </article>

            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-9">
            <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-fontPrimary/70 border-b border-fontPrimary/35 pb-2 mb-4">
                Education
            </h2>

            <div class="pl-4 border-l-2 border-fontPrimary/30 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-0.5">
                <div>
                    <p class="font-semibold text-fontPrimary text-sm">
                        Bachelor of Technology in Computer Science
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-sm text-fontPrimary/80 mt-0.5">University of Cochin, India</p>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs text-fontPrimary/70 shrink-0">2014 – 2018</span>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-9">
            <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-fontPrimary/70 border-b border-fontPrimary/35 pb-2 mb-4">
                Certifications
            </h2>

            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-fontPrimary/85">
                <li class="pl-4 border-l-2 border-fontPrimary/30">
                    Certified Scrum Master (CSM) — Scrum Alliance
                </li>
                <li class="pl-4 border-l-2 border-fontPrimary/30">
                    Certified Secure Web Application Engineer (CSWAE) — Mile2
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

    </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    @media print {
        article {
            max-width: 100% !important;
        }
    }
</style>